# Converge: five Moxen pay {4}{R} with white, blue, black, red and green, so X = 5 (CR 207.2c). Five damage to a 0/2 Ornithopter is
# three above lethal: excess damage is 3 (CR 120.10), so the top three cards of Bot1's library (Mountain, Lightning Bolt, Island)
# are exiled and may be played - the exiled Mountain as the land drop and the exiled Bolt, cast for the Mountain's {R}, at Bot2.
# Bot2's library has the Island it would have drawn and nothing of it is exiled.

